envoi.description:
**Off by default.** When on, the integration sends the SAME content as the manual export (grid, solar, battery, house consumption and only the devices you chose, under a neutral name, at the chosen step) to analyse.sbg-energy.com, with your postcode, at most once a month (from the 2nd), only the days the service does not have yet. It is the integration's only outgoing network call. These data are a source of your home. Purpose: the report of your home, updated at each send, and the "better offer" e-mail alert; and only if you tick "Improve SBG tools", postcode statistics and a pseudonymised copy. 5-minute step kept 12 months then grouped into quarter-hours, everything deleted after 3 rolling years; at most three homes and three Home Assistant installations per account, only one per home; erasable from your account; free during the beta. Conditions: {conditions}

Consumption data may reflect the activity of the people living in the home. If you share this home, consider informing them that you use this service.

SBG Energy account: {compte}. Home: {logement}.
